# Environment Variables for Today Sky
# 
# ⚠️ SECURITY NOTICE:
# All API keys should ONLY be set in Netlify's environment variables dashboard.
# DO NOT store actual API keys in this file or commit them to the repository.
# These variables are accessed by Netlify Functions (serverless functions), not the frontend.
#
# To set these in Netlify:
# 1. Go to your Netlify site dashboard
# 2. Navigate to Site configuration > Environment variables
# 3. Add each variable below with your actual API key values

# OpenWeatherMap API Key
# Get your free API key at: https://openweathermap.org/api
# Used by: netlify/functions/geocode.ts (geocoding), netlify/functions/weather.ts (future)
# Free tier: 60 calls/minute, 1,000,000 calls/month
OPENWEATHER_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
